{"id":69276,"date":"2025-10-01T07:52:21","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T06:52:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69276"},"modified":"2026-10-14T08:13:41","modified_gmt":"2026-10-14T07:13:41","slug":"corrida-das-castanhas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-castanhas\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Castanhas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida das Castanhas 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida das Castanhas 2026<\/strong> (15\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>14 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), celebrando a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o do ver\u00e3o de S\u00e3o Martinho na cidade de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. O evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Kids Race de 400 metros<\/strong> no <strong>Largo do Galo (Ajuda)<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> a partida conjunta da <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>, da <strong>Mini-Corrida de 6 km<\/strong> e da <strong>Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong> na <strong>Alameda Keil do Amaral<\/strong>, em pleno Parque Florestal de Monsanto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado combina a envolvente arborizada do pulm\u00e3o verde de <strong>Monsanto<\/strong> com as ruas hist\u00f3ricas da freguesia da <strong>Ajuda<\/strong>, culminando na meta instalada no <strong>Largo do Galo<\/strong>. As dist\u00e2ncias competitivas de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e <strong>6 km<\/strong> contam com cronometragem por chip e destinam-se a atletas maiores de 18 anos, enquanto a <strong>Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong> \u00e9 aberta a participantes de todas as idades e a <strong>Kids Race (400 m)<\/strong> acolhe os jovens corredores at\u00e9 aos 12 anos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica outonal do calend\u00e1rio lisboeta destaca-se pelo tradicional magusto e conv\u00edvio na linha de chegada, oferecendo <strong>castanhas assadas e \u00e1gua-p\u00e9<\/strong> a todos os participantes que completem a prova. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina nos 10 km e na Mini-Corrida de 6 km, bem como aos tr\u00eas primeiros de cada um dos nove escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios da prova principal de 10 km.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Alameda Keil do Amaral (Monsanto) \/ Largo do Galo (Ajuda), Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"